#: ../../index.rst:2
msgid "pymarvin"
msgstr "pymarvin"

#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Python bindings for Tianji Marvin robot control, offline kinematics and interference "
"checks, using uv, CMake, scikit-build-core and nanobind. The distribution and import "
"names are both ``pymarvin``."
msgstr ""
"Tianji Marvin 机器人控制、离线运动学和干涉检测的 Python 绑定，使用 uv、CMake、scikit-build-core 和 nanobind "
"构建。发行包名和导入名均为 ``pymarvin``。"

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"The package compiles the included SDK sources instead of loading vendor binary "
"libraries. Prebuilt wheels support Linux x86_64/aarch64 and Windows x64 on CPython "
"3.10–3.14."
msgstr ""
"本包编译附带的 SDK 源码，不加载厂商预编译库。预编译 wheel 支持 CPython 3.10–3.14，以及 Linux x86_64/aarch64 和 "
"Windows x64。"

